      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think there should be a way to manually select avatars to allow higher phys bones. Most of my avatars now have phys bones disabled on quest, and since I usually only play with my gf and she plays from quest, it just seems like a good idea to allow manual override of the phys bone limits for each player.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
