        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've had really good performance in the beta even with an almost full lobby of people shown. To see this amazing feature limted like it is now is just disappointing. If this could be changed so we more than a cap of 8 that would be swell. Or at least allow your players to disable this cap at their own risk. But with the performance i saw, i see no clear reasons on why its limited the way it is now. But again it would be really nice if this could be changed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
