        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The beta at a full world worked wonderfully and you really underestimate how well the quest works sometimes. A lot of avatars are not functional now thanks to the cap, and I've seen many creators no longer motivated to make new avatars with physbones bc with such a hard cap what's the point ? Anyways, at least raise the cap to 12-13 at the very least. Or make a toggle in settings to turn physbones on or off. Or have a toggle to allow seeing more bones than the cap. But toggles could fix everything. And to prevent complaints you could have it by default set to off or the cap and then you can manually turn bones on or increased. That way going further is an optional decision made by the user.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
