      "value": "You just ignored the limted power on Quest.\nAnd so your request will just not accepted.\nEverything must run good, even rooms until 16 players at same time. Which is important to keep VRChat nice for Quest users, or we will have more angry Quest users due too low fps.\nThat is exactly VRChat devs and Meta don't want see it.",
